<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.7">
<l>maṇṇil piṟantumaṇṇā kummā ṉiṭappēriṭ ṭaṅku</l>
<l>eṇṇa moṉṟiṉṟi yirukkumē ḻaimaṉi carkāḷ</l>
<l>kaṇṇuk kiṉiya karumukil vaṇṇaṉnā mamē</l>
<l>naṇṇumiṉ nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>O Foolish men who, having been born in this world,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] giving the names of humans born in this world</l>
<l>[to your children],</l>
<l rend="indent">without a single thought for the next world!</l>
<l>Adhere to the names of the dark cloud hued [Lord],</l>
<l rend="indent">pleasing to the eye.</l>
<l>The mother of Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
